secubox-streamlit (1.4.0-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Ship the per-app LXC assets under /usr/lib/secubox/streamlit/lxc/:
    streamlit-app@.service (one systemd instance per app, Restart=no) and
    streamlit-launch (its ExecStart, reads the per-app .streamlit.toml
